WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.200
Who pays for journalism shapes how big it gets.

2
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.200
Nine kinds of newsroom, sorted by who pays.

3
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:20.400
Four of them hold 48 of the 55 organizations over $10 million.

4
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.200
31 organizations grew past $10 million.

5
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:32.400
30 of them did it one of six ways.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.600
The oldest are the biggest: 24 of 38 founded before 1995 run over $10 million.

7
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:46.600
But who pays matters more than when an organization started.
